### Using the information to solve

Let's plug $\blueD{b'(t_0)}=\blueD{-13}$, $\maroonD{h(t_0)}=\maroonD{1}$, $\goldD{b(t_0)}=\goldD{5}$, and $\purpleC{h'(t_0)}=\purpleC{6}$ into the expression for $A'(t_0)$:

$\begin{align}
A'(t_0)&=\dfrac{\blueD{b'(t_0)}\maroonD{h(t_0)}+\goldD{b(t_0)}\purpleC{h'(t_0)}}{2}
\\\\
&=\dfrac{(\blueD{-13})(\maroonD{1})+(\goldD{5})(\purpleC{6})}{2}
\\\\
&=8.5
\end{align}$
